OL,3,GNEWSAStorm causes tree to collapse on
OL,4,Acricket pavilion
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a cricket club have been
OL,7,Fleft "heartbroken" after their pavilion
OL,8,Fwas damaged when a tree fell during
OL,9,FStorm Boelo.
OL,11,FStrong winds caused the tree, believed
OL,12,Fto be hundreds of years old, to
OL,13,Fcollapse on a building at Woodham
OL,14,FMortimer Cricket Club near Maldon,
OL,15,FEssex, on Saturday.
OL,17,FGeorge Verlander, the club's
OL,18,Fdevelopment officer, said the women's
OL,19,Ftoilets had been particularly damaged.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
