OL,3,GNEWSAStorm causes tree to collapse on
OL,4,Acricket pavilion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe confirmed that no-one had been hurt
OL,7,Fand the club was waiting for its
OL,8,Finsurance company to assess the damage
OL,9,Fbefore it made longer-term plans for
OL,10,Fthe clear-up and eventual rebuild.
